{
  "name": "scenario-twelve-miles-out",
  "description": "Boscali Summer chapter 1, Twelve Miles Out. The sim plugin wants the mission name to equal the launch argument, so first copy modules/Scenario/Assets/twelve-miles-out.scenario to <game>/BepInEx/config/BoscaliSummer/scenarios/tmo-sim.scenario with the id tmo-sim, the title scenario:tmo-sim and the campaign tmo-sim, and delete progress.txt there. The private install needs Blueprinter (the convoy is the addon BS_ContainerFeeder). Captures every intro shot, then the PMC and Pirates HQs, peace (no side at peace tracks the other), the seated A-19, the convoy, and walks the waves by knocking out each one through ScenarioAutomation.Disable.",
  "mission": "scenario:tmo-sim",
  "mods": [
    "boscalisummer"
  ],
  "timeout_s": 640,
  "environment": {
    "config": {
      "bepinex": {
        "Logging.Disk": {
          "WriteUnityLog": true
        }
      }
    }
  },
